\\la K_r"'^{-1}F_s,E_r'"\\ra=\\del_{rs}\\theta u"'^{-1/n?}q''^{-1/n}(1-'"\\theta)?,
\\qquad
\\la K_r"'^{-1}F_s,E_rK_r'"\\ra=\\del_{rs}\\theta(1-\\theta?).
\\]
The remaining pairings between "'$'"\\{F_s,K_r"'^{-1}F_s,'"\\hK"'^{'"\\pm1}\\}"'$ and
$'"\\{E_r,E_rK_r,\\hK"'^{'"\\pm1}\\}"'$ are zero except for the Cartan--Cartan
values of Lemma~'"\\ref{lem:cartan}.
\\end{lemma}
\\begin{proof}
