$'"\\del(E_r)=E_r\\otimes K_r+1\\otimes E_r"'$.  For the first identity,
'"\\[
\\la F_s,E_rK_r\\ra=\\la (F_s)_1,K_r\\ra\\la(F_s)_2,E_r\\ra
