$a(s,r)-a(s,r+1)$ at $s=r$: $a(r,r)-a(r,r+1)=('"\\frac1n-1)-\\frac1n=-1"'$,
so $'"\\la K_r"'^{-1},K_r'"\\ra=q"'^{+1}$ and
$'"\\la F_r,E_rK_r\\ra=\\theta q"'$.  The bookkeeping is: using (P) directly,
$'"\\la K_s"'^{-1},K_r'"\\ra=q"'^{-(a(s,r)-a(s,r+1))}$; for $r=s$ this is
$q''^{-(-1)}=q$.  Hence
'"\\[
\\la F_s,E_rK_r\\ra=\\del_{rs}\\theta q. \\tag{"'$'"\\dagger"'$}
'"\\]
Similarly
\\[
\\la K_r"'^{-1}F_s,E_r'"\\ra
=\\la K_r"'^{-1},E_r'"\\ra\\la ?,?\\ra+\\la K_r"'^{-1},1'"\\ra\\la F_s,E_r\\ra
=0+\\del_{rs}\\theta, \\tag{"'$'"\\ddagger"'$}
'"\\]
