'"\\begin{lemma}[Cartan pairing values]\\label{lem:cartan}
For "'$K_r='"\\hK_r\\hK_{r+1}"'^{-1}$ and all $i,j,r$:
'"\\[
\\la K_r,\\hK_j\\ra=q"'^{'"\\del_{jr}-\\del_{j,r+1}},\\qquad
