  net $q''^{0}$: contributes $t_{i,i+1}s_{i+1,i}$.
'"\\item "'$'"\\tht\\,\\hK_{i+1}"'^{(-)-1}'"\\cK_i"'^{(+)}'"\\hK_{i+1}"'^{(+)}
  ='"\\tht\\,\\hK_i"'^{(+)}'"\\hK_{i+1}"'^{(-)-1}=q''^{0}$-times
  $t_{ii}s_{i+1,i+1}$: contributes $'"\\tht\\,t_{ii}s_{i+1,i+1}"'$.
'"\\item "'$-'"\\tht\\,\\hK_{i+1}"'^{(-)-1}'"\\cK_i"'^{(-)-1}'"\\hK_{i+1}"'^{(+)}
  =-'"\\tht\\,\\hK_i"'^{(-)-1}'"\\hK_{i+1}"'^{(+)}
  =-'"\\tht\\,t_{i+1,i+1}s_{ii}"'$.
'"\\end{itemize}
This gives "'$s_{i+1,i}t_{i,i+1}
=t_{i,i+1}s_{i+1,i}+'"\\tht(t_{ii}s_{i+1,i+1}-t_{i+1,i+1}s_{ii})"'$; the
exact channel computation (Remark~'"\\ref{rem:verify}) returns the
coefficients "'$1,'"\\ \\tht q"'^{+1},'"\\ -\\tht q"'^{-1}$ for the three terms, i.e.'"\\
the scavenging of the second and third terms carries the Cartan factors
of "'$'"\\cK_i"'^{('"\\pm)}"'$ across the neighbouring generator Cartans with
nontrivial scalars $q''^{'"\\alpha_i(i+1)}"'$ and $q''^{-'"\\alpha_i(i+1)}"'$
respectively (they come from the relative order of
$'"\\hK_{i+1}"'^{('"\\pm)-1}"'$ against $'"\\hK_i"'^{('"\\mp)}"'$ in the normal form, via
